      "title": "Rubicon Research Limited Recommends Dividend for the Financial Year Ended March 31, 2026",
      "body": "Rubicon Research Limited at its board meeting held on 29 May, 2026 recommended a Dividend of INR 1.50 per equity share of the face value of INR 1 each fully paid up, for the financial year ended March 31, 2026. The Dividend shall be paid within 30 days from the date of declaration by the Members at the AGM.",
