      "date": "2026-04-15T00:00:00.000Z",
      "title": "Rubicon Research Limited (NSEI:RUBICON) agreed to acquire 85% stake in arinna Lifesciences Pvt. Ltd. for INR 1.8 billion.",
      "body": "Rubicon Research Limited (NSEI:RUBICON) agreed to acquire 85% stake in arinna Lifesciences Pvt. Ltd. for INR 1.8 billion on April 15, 2026. A cash consideration of INR 1.76 billion will be paid by Rubicon Research Limited. Upon acquisition, Arinna will become a subsidiary of the Company.\r\n The acquisition is expected to be completed within one month from the date of the signing of the transaction documents or by such other timelines as may be mutually agreed between the parties. The final consideration remains subject to adjustments on the closing date.",
